Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:12.06,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}This guy's the new Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hold up, he could just be a gofer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:17.88,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,G-Good. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:20.17,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,I'll take you to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:40.48,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.77,0:02:05.89,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}An apartment with a basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:08.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pretty run-of-the-mill for the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.57,0:02:11.73,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:12.79,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:16.76,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,In here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:31.59,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Way to show up, Mr. Unarmed and Butt Naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:37.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:41.34,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Indeed, I am Emperor Rahazelt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:43.10,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Now, regarding your actions yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:46.31,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I shall disregard it out of pure mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:49.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Screw this kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:52.55,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Ah, you're younger than I expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:56.91,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,As for myself, you'd be surprised to know \NI'm actually 1,300,000 years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.91,0:02:59.39,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he trying to get a rise out of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.39,0:03:00.53,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}For what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:01.74,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}God, he's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:04.82,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not good, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:07.74,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}This may be a strategy \Nto sniff out my identity...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.19,0:03:12.77,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,D-Don't kid me like that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:14.78,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm pleased to meet you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:16.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Second Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:21.21,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Hey, making up my age didn't work, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:22.96,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:24.98,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}These guys better be kidding...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.15,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I mean, they can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:33.83,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}They do think I'm some nutcase \Nthat exposed himself, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:32.29,Default-Top,Souma,0,0,0,,Who are you kidding with that insane number?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:34.44,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,You think so, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.63,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Explains why they're so relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:39.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess that makes things easier, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:40.17,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:44.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm Raion Ouno. Here's my ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:49.12,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,So? What's your objective?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:52.63,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,Proof of Identification\N{\fs14\b0}This identification proves that the individual\Nbelow is a student at the listed school. \N{\fs17\b1}Grade: 8th Grade, Class 3 \NName: Raion Ouno \NSchool Name: City of Suginami\N{\fs14}Suginami West Fifth Middle School
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:52.63,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I had a lot of questions to ask you, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.37,0:03:57.76,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,How you killed with Tasuketsu, and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:04:00.97,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,A multitude of methods. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:05.84,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}They don't seem suspicious based on \Ntheir answers and overall demeanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:10.46,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}They may have been faking as the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:13.69,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the daily announcements \Nmust have come from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:17.15,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which would make my next move...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:23.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I share a lot of values with the Emperor, \Nso I came hoping to help in any way I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:31.62,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's find out... if you're \Nmy enemy or my ally!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:33.71,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What values do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:36.68,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Values about Tasuketsu, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:40.88,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,People nowadays take life \Nso lightly. Good riddance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:49.90,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Hey, kiddo. Is that really how you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:51.03,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:53.94,Italics,Raion,0,0,0,,Was that girl there a second ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:57.78,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I'm asking you a question. \NTell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:03.33,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Are you serious? Why would\NI be honest when I'm probing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:09.02,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Go on. Did you mean what you just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:12.58,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Of course I didn't, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:17.21,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,If I was in front of the Emperor with \Na weapon, I'd beat them 10,000 times!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:25.61,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,So that's your truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:29.30,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Beating someone 10,000 times... \Nis pretty intense, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.89,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Well, well. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:36.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}W-What happened?! How?! \NI didn't even mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:39.15,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:43.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}For whatever reason, I couldn't \Nlie in response to her question!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:45.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:47.76,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who are these guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:54.42,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Hey, take it easy. So you're against \Nthe Emperor behind Tasuketsu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:58.45,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Then we're probably \Non the same side, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.16,0:06:02.27,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,All right, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:05.27,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Let's hear your full story, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.27,0:06:08.39,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,There's no use in lying, \Nas you've probably figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.79,0:06:11.63,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not sure I can trust them,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.11,0:06:17.81,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I do know that they've definitely \Ngot the upper hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:22.91,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We'll get to the details later. \NJust give us the gist of your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:26.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I wanted to see the current Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:34.33,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,One month ago, Tasuketsu suddenly began \Nat the hands of someone named the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:36.93,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,and it killed off most of humanity...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:40.87,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But out of nowhere came \Nan announcement that it had ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.21,Comp big-an8,Raion,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,1)\an1\fax-0.4\frz17.75\pos(158,161)}As of this moment,\NTasuketsu has concluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:42.59,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Raion,0,0,0,,{\pos(318,160)\c&HF8EEE5&\clip(m 464 183 l 448 193 35 187 46 138 474 164 478 175)}As of this moment, Tasuketsu has concluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:45.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I was lucky enough to survive, but I couldn't \Nmake sense of anything that had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:51.31,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I had a hunch that the current Emperor was \Nseparate from the Emperor that held Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.35,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That threw me for even more of a loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:56.92,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I just needed to know what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.07,0:07:00.40,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Why did you think it was a separate person?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:04.60,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,There's no way to find out \Nif the daily executions are real,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:07.24,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,and the Emperor stopped talking \Never since Tasuketsu ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:10.75,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Jeez, Gobo. You're getting exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:13.45,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,This is bad, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:14.94,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gobo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:15.66,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Eren.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.58,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:21.32,Default-Top,Eren,0,0,0,,Was that really the truth? Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:20.64,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,W-Wait, don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:23.05,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yes, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:24.81,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:27.53,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Oh, so you don't know about the Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:29.26,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,We'll fill you in later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:31.50,Italics,Raion,0,0,0,,The Rights?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:34.71,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Looks like it's safe to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.15,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The Emperor is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:39.94,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Or rather, we defeated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:41.44,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:45.26,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We couldn't revive the victims \Nor recover civilization...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:50.03,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Given that we're now living \Nin a lawless society,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:53.71,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,our only choice to maintain public order was \Nto impersonate the Emperor and instill fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:00.57,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}So they really were...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:04.69,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}These guys really were just trying to protect \Nthe world by acting as the Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:08.72,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,There's a lot I want to say, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:11.68,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,If I were to boil it down to one thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:16.42,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,thank you, Current Emperor Rahazelt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.07,0:08:21.36,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Very well, good citizen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}He still gets on my nerves, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.87,0:08:29.34,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,He doesn't actually go by that. \NJust call him Gobo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.91,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Is that even a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:34.16,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Come on, Nishime! For real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:39.12,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nishime? Who actually are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:43.34,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.10,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Hikari?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:49.09,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Are you okay? What's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:51.90,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,It's urgent! Hurry, turn on the TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:53.64,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,KHN Broadcasting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:57.15,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,KHN?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.96,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:13.99,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,The Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.74,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,W-What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:19.11,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Is it someone copying Raion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.11,0:09:23.57,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Wait... isn't this a bit different?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:26.00,Italics,Raion,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:31.49,Italics,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I am the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.49,0:09:32.88,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Queen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:34.97,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Who could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:38.23,Italics,Queen,0,0,0,,This is a declaration of war \Nagainst the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.23,0:09:41.73,Italics,Queen,0,0,0,,I'll use whatever means \N necessary to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:44.73,Italics,Queen,0,0,0,,I shall become the Empress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.27,0:09:47.41,Italics,Queen,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.59,0:09:54.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew someone else would eventually \Ncatch on and aim to overthrow the Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:58.58,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Wha—is this for real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.22,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,W-What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.93,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Am I gonna get ki—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:02.97,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:05.25,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's too early to determine anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:07.55,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,We're right here with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:08.71,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:13.95,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,But they said I won't be \Nable to get away, for real...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:16.27,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Well, we won't let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:22.33,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,As long as I'm alive, Raha—\NGobo... you'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:25.05,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,They'll have to go through me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:28.36,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,"You'll be safe"? What do you mean by that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:32.49,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It means I'll join your group \Nand protect Gobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:34.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Should I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:39.06,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,I mean, we don't really know you \Nwell enough to have you join...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:41.57,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You have plenty of time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:44.11,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Judging by the circumstances, \NI'd say you're in a dire situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.11,0:10:45.39,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:46.68,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Gobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:50.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Without you, society would \Nhave lost all sense of public order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:56.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You're still a needed presence here, \Nand I'm grateful to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:10:58.30,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Raion...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:02.70,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That's why I wanna protect you... \Nno, I swear I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:05.02,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,For now, who cares about anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:14.74,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Very well, then! You shall \Nbecome my loyal servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.74,0:11:17.03,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Stop being so condescending!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:19.99,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,So what's your take on that announcement?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:25.96,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I assume it's a genuine declaration of war, \Nwell-knowing the Emperor's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:29.63,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,They took the same approach as me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:33.11,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,so they were likely trying to provoke us \Nand show they see through our situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:34.92,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Definitely a confident type.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:38.47,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, they used KHN Broadcasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:41.95,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Then the Queen will be there \Nif we go right now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:43.07,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:44.47,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:49.44,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It's a declaration of war. Why take \Nthe risk of sending in the Queen herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:50.94,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Makes sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:54.24,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,There may be an ambush \Nor a trap waiting for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:58.48,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But if they're just waiting to see \Nour next move to judge our strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:01.31,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,it's natural to assume that they \Ndon't know anything about us yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:03.91,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,So we're basically evenly matched for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:08.85,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But they've made a pretty bold \Nfirst move with that announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:10.29,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Better stay on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:12.42,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}He rationally assessed the situation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:15.92,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}and determined all that from \Njust one short announcement...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:20.35,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's definitely sharp, but \Na different type from Saneatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.35,0:12:23.68,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Either way, there's no need \Nto panic for now—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:27.72,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:30.87,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That girl! Where's the girl \Nwho came in just a second ago?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:31.46,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:32.56,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,You mean Hikari?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:34.93,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. Where did she go, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.79,0:12:36.78,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Ouno?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:40.41,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should have paid better attention sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:41.75,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please don't let it be too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:45.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hey, where ya off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:47.74,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Heading to see the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.54,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:53.62,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:57.19,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The Emperor's broadcast is usually at 23:55.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:13:00.97,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,There's no telling if anyone's \Nwatching outside that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:04.73,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Which is why I did my broadcast \Nat the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.27,0:13:08.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But you noticed that announcement \Nin the middle of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:11.68,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,And it was only airing on KHN Broadcasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:15.11,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:18.58,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The Queen didn't seem to \Nhave any information on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:23.82,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Which means you know what she's \Ndoing, but you're not her spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:29.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You have information on both, but \Nyou won't provide that to either side...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:31.04,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Pretty perplexing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:33.92,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.88,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Who are you? What's your motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:40.32,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,I'm willing to tell you on a few conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:43.99,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll take any dirt you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.99,0:13:47.31,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm willing to consider \Nmost conditions in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:52.43,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Fine, only if you accept. First...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:53.44,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Immobilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.45,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}W-What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.77,0:14:14.82,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her head and body instantly—but how?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.11,0:14:20.42,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}He stopped her from talking? \NIs he the Queen's subordinate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:24.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Assuming he was listening \Nto that conversation...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:26.93,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:28.89,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Materialization!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.89,0:14:30.18,Italics,Raion,0,0,0,,{\an8}Prime Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:30.85,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Perfect Wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:33.60,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,You stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Shoot! He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:39.23,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:48.32,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:50.79,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,He's behind that building!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:52.58,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Materialization!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:54.41,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Harpy Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:59.91,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Bring back that guy who took off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:02.42,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,If you need to beat him up \Nin the process, so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:05.63,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You okay, Souma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:08.51,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, this ain't nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:12.89,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is what the Rights are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:17.97,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is insane. \NIt's superpowers in real life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.26,0:15:27.03,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,My arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.32,0:15:32.26,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,H-Hey! You're gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:33.34,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Stay out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:37.39,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Never hesitate when going \Nagainst a Prime Rights owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:39.93,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Unless you wanna end up like Hikari!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:50.89,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Never forget that! We didn't fight \Nour way here out of pure luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:55.82,Italics,Raion,0,0,0,,It's not something you \Ncan do half-heartedly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:15:59.77,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard, baldy macho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:02.22,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Just a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:08.69,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've lost all sensation... \NI don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:10.24,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Kunashiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.58,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What's your Prime Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:17.10,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Immobilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.78,0:16:21.29,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}How?! I didn't mean to answer—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.80,0:16:23.97,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What kind of ability is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:28.06,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's because of her Prime Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:39.13,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was able to keep quiet through resisting...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:41.87,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}So it's not a Prime Right, but a Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:45.40,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}Luckily, I didn't end up exposing \Nmy abilities or weakness...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:46.97,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,He resisted!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.97,0:16:49.15,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Nice Eren, you did more than enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:51.57,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Prime Right, huh? Then you're dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:53.91,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Attack, Harpy Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:55.91,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Immobilize!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:00.83,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Harpy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.93,0:17:05.59,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,If I really wanted to kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:10.78,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,You'd die just by moving your body \Neven a few millimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.01,0:17:14.26,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,You guys, this is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:17.97,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We'll suffer the same fate if \Nhe immobilizes a part of our body...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:21.21,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,I can still materialize one more beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:24.08,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,but what good would that do \Nif they end up like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:27.11,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we just let him go \Nso we don't get killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.43,0:17:29.57,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good, be afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:34.17,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}As long as you don't know the exercising \Nconditions, you won't be able to move anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:37.81,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's trying to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:39.61,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even with that power?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.44,0:17:43.00,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why not do what he did to that Hikari girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:45.96,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Immobilization...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:47.17,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Immobilize!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.07,0:17:55.30,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Their heads fell after the fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:59.89,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}His confident demeanor despite \Nthe injury to his left arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:02.43,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Checkmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.17,0:18:08.66,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We have no other choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:11.57,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Don't move and listen \Nto what I'm about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:14.36,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I know a way to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:17.58,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}He came up with a plan in this short time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:27.58,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perfect, they're not going to \Npursue me. Then I can just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:29.95,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Fine, we surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:36.09,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,We'll tell you everything. \NJust spare us our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.52,0:18:38.58,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}This must be my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:40.86,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}I planned on just making a run for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:45.09,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}but Lady Kisaragi will be happy \Nif I bring home more information.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:48.72,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Fine, let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:54.20,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,This card here actually holds \Nthe key to the Emperor's secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:55.30,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,That card?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:56.98,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:19:02.16,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,This card shows the Emperor's whereabouts, \Nwhich is why Hikari wanted it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:03.91,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Emperor's whereabouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:07.63,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,What does it say? Read it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:12.64,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Materialization, \NTungsten Cube!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:22.48,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,In order for you to exercise your Prime \NRight, you have to point at your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:23.57,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Descend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:26.61,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,D-Dammit! Immobilize!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.33,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,It won't stop?! But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:32.86,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did they do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.29,0:19:35.25,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,I used my Right of Priority
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.62,0:19:38.80,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,so the Materialization Right\N takes precedence,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:40.16,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,so that won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:43.09,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Right?! What's happe—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.80,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,W-We better not look...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:56.38,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah... You too, Gobo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:59.40,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Whoa... for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:06.27,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is... the reality \Nof the world today...{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:10.36,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}These guys must have been sad \Nto see one of them killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:12.91,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}but they were able to let it go and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:17.50,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're that strong... this group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:21.78,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You were great help. Your plan, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.81,0:20:24.66,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,I know a way to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.13,0:20:27.25,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,This guy's Right of Immobilization...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:30.50,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,It's likely performed \Non whatever he points at,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:33.09,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,and it's released when he stops pointing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:38.80,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,You with the knit hat. Place a large, \Nheavy object above his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:41.73,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,He'll have no choice but to immobilize it \Nto avoid getting crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:45.44,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,Once he immobilizes it, we'll block his path
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:50.40,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,and wait for him to bleed out \Nuntil... checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:53.66,Flashback,Nishime,0,0,0,,Then let's use my Right in conjunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:57.15,Flashback,Nishime,0,0,0,,It'll get the job done for sure, sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.68,0:20:59.15,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:02.16,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.82,0:21:05.40,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You're someone we need in our group.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.43,0:21:13.25,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Let's protect the world together, Raion Ouno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:19.97,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,The Key
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:18.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah.
